---
import BaseHead from "/src/components/BaseHead.astro";
import Header from "/src/components/sections/Header.astro";
import Footer from "/src/components/sections/Footer.astro";
import Projects from "/src/components/sections/Projects.astro";
import HeroSection from "/src/components/sections/HeroSection.astro";
import GlowLineSeparator from "/src/components/ui/separator/GlowLineSeparator.astro";
---


<html lang="en" data-theme="dark" class="dark">
  <head>
    <BaseHead title="Project 3: One Piece x NUMI Tea Boxes" description="Project 3" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <Header />
    <main>
      <HeroSection title="One Piece x NUMI Tea Boxes" subtitle="Packaging design for One Piece themed NUMI tea boxes." />
      <GlowLineSeparator />
      <div class="project-content">
        <div class="hero-images">
      <img src="/project-3-mockup-1.png" alt="Project 3 mockup 1">
      <img src="/project-3-mockup-2.png" alt="Project 3 mockup 2">
        </div>
      <p>This design was created for my Typography class. We were tasked with creating a collaboration package design for a tea brand of our choice.
        The tea brand I decided on was NUMI tea, with my collaboration being the show, One Piece. I made four seperate tea box designs, each one being base on a different character from the show.
        The colors I used for each box were also chosen based on the characters each box was based on.  
      </p>
      </div>
      <GlowLineSeparator />
    </main>
    <Footer />
  </body>
</html>

<style>
.hero-images{
  max-width: max-content;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction:row;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
img {
  display: block;
  margin-left: auto;
  margin-right: auto;
  padding: 2rem 0 3rem 0;
  width: 45%; /* Optional: adjust as needed */
}
</style>
